OL,3,GNEWSANew hate crime reporting hubs in
OL,4,Amosques will 'remove barriers'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"As a community, we've just been told
OL,7,Fover the years, you've got to be
OL,8,Fbetter. You are guests in this country;
OL,9,Fyou won't be treated equally," said
OL,10,FFaisal Mahmood, a community leader from
OL,11,FPeterborough, on growing up as a Muslim
OL,12,Fin the UK.
OL,14,FAccording to Mahmood, this deep-rooted,
OL,15,Fingrained belief explained why many
OL,16,Fvictims did not report hate crimes. He
OL,17,Fsaid that over time, racist or
OL,18,FIslamophobic abuse was often absorbed
OL,19,Fand accepted by victims as "the way it
OL,20,Fis", which he believed led to a
OL,21,Fsignificant gap in official statistics
OL,22,Fand needed to change.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
