OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1789387012
OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew hate crime reporting hubs in
OL,4,Amosques will 'remove barriers'
OL,5,
OL,6,FCambridgeshire Police said about 600
OL,7,Fhate crime incidents (of all types)
OL,8,Fwere recorded in Peterborough between
OL,9,FAugust 2025 and August 2026. But to
OL,10,Fhelp make reporting more accessible, it
OL,11,Fhas set up hate crime reporting centres
OL,12,Fat four city mosques as part of a new
OL,13,Finitiative.
OL,15,FMahmood, secretary of the Joint Mosque
OL,16,FCouncil, said these centres would
OL,17,Fremove barriers and make it "easier and
OL,18,Fsafer for victims from the community to
OL,19,Fcome forward".
